<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>海关缉私情报分析报告 - {{ generated_at }}</title>
    <style>
        * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
        body {
            font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", "PingFang SC", "Hiragino Sans GB", "Microsoft YaHei", sans-serif;
            background: #f5f7fa;
            color: #1f2937;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }
        .container { max-width: 1400px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 20px; }
        .header {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1e40af 0%, #3b82f6 100%);
            color: white;
            padding: 30px;
            border-radius: 12px;
            margin-bottom: 24px;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(30, 64, 175, 0.2);
        }
        .header h1 { font-size: 28px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px; }
        .header .meta { opacity: 0.9; font-size: 14px; }
        .section { background: white; border-radius: 12px; padding: 24px; margin-bottom: 20px; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.06); }
        .section h2 { font-size: 20px; color: #1e40af; margin-bottom: 16px; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; }
        .section h2::before { content: ""; width: 4px; height: 20px; background: #3b82f6; border-radius: 2px; }
        .stats-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(200px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; margin-bottom: 20px; }
        .stat-card { padding: 20px; border-radius: 10px; text-align: center; }
        .stat-card.high { background: #fef2f2; border: 1px solid #fecaca; }
        .stat-card.medium { background: #fffbeb; border: 1px solid #fde68a; }
        .stat-card.low { background: #f0fdf4; border: 1px solid #bbf7d0; }
        .stat-card.total { background: #eff6ff; border: 1px solid #bfdbfe; }
        .stat-card .value { font-size: 32px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 4px; }
        .stat-card.high .value { color: #dc2626; }
        .stat-card.medium .value { color: #d97706; }
        .stat-card.low .value { color: #059669; }
        .stat-card.total .value { color: #1e40af; }
        .stat-card .label { font-size: 14px; color: #6b7280; }
        table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin-top: 12px; font-size: 14px; }
        th { background: #f3f4f6; padding: 12px; text-align: left; font-weight: 600; color: #374151; border-bottom: 2px solid #e5e7eb; }
        td { padding: 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid #f3f4f6; }
        tr:hover { background: #f9fafb; }
        .risk-badge { display: inline-block; padding: 4px 12px; border-radius: 20px; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; }
        .risk-badge.high { background: #fef2f2; color: #dc2626; border: 1px solid #fecaca; }
        .risk-badge.medium { background: #fffbeb; color: #d97706; border: 1px solid #fde68a; }
        .risk-badge.low { background: #f0fdf4; color: #059669; border: 1px solid #bbf7d0; }
        .type-tag { display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px; border-radius: 4px; font-size: 12px; background: #e0e7ff; color: #4338ca; margin-right: 4px; }
        .detail-panel { background: #f9fafb; border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px; margin-top: 8px; font-size: 13px; }
        .detail-panel .field { margin-bottom: 6px; }
        .detail-panel .field span.label { color: #6b7280; font-weight: 500; }
        .trend-chart { height: 200px; background: linear-gradient(to right, #e0e7ff, #dbeafe); border-radius: 8px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; color: #6366f1; font-weight: 500; }
        .empty-state { text-align: center; padding: 40px; color: #9ca3af; }
        .case-match { background: #fef3c7; border-radius: 6px; padding: 8px 12px; margin-top: 8px; font-size: 12px; }
        .case-match strong { color: #92400e; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <div class="header">
            <h1>🔍 海关缉私情报分析报告</h1>
            <div class="meta">
                生成时间: {{ generated_at }}
                {% if report_period.start %}
                | 分析周期: {{ report_period.start }} 至 {{ report_period.end }}
                {% endif %}
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="section">
            <h2>📊 统计摘要</h2>
            <div class="stats-grid">
                <div class="stat-card total">
                    <div class="value">{{ summary.total }}</div>
                    <div class="label">异常线索总数</div>
                </div>
                <div class="stat-card high">
                    <div class="value">{{ summary.by_risk['高风险'] }}</div>
                    <div class="label">高风险</div>
                </div>
                <div class="stat-card medium">
                    <div class="value">{{ summary.by_risk['中风险'] }}</div>
                    <div class="label">中风险</div>
                </div>
                <div class="stat-card low">
                    <div class="value">{{ summary.by_risk['低风险'] }}</div>
                    <div class="label">低风险</div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <h3 style="margin: 20px 0 12px; color: #374151; font-size: 16px;">按检测类型分类</h3>
            <table>
                <thead>
                    <tr>
                        <th>检测类型</th>
                        <th>高风险</th>
                        <th>中风险</th>
                        <th>低风险</th>
                        <th>合计</th>
                    </tr>
                </thead>
                <tbody>
                    {% for dtype, data in summary.by_type.items() %}
                    <tr>
                        <td><span class="type-tag">{{ data.name }}</span></td>
                        <td style="color: #dc2626; font-weight: 600;">{{ data['高风险'] }}</td>
                        <td style="color: #d97706; font-weight: 600;">{{ data['中风险'] }}</td>
                        <td style="color: #059669; font-weight: 600;">{{ data['低风险'] }}</td>
                        <td style="font-weight: 600;">{{ data.count }}</td>
                    </tr>
                    {% endfor %}
                </tbody>
            </table>

            {% if summary.has_case_matches > 0 %}
            <div class="trend-chart" style="margin-top: 20px;">
                📈 风险趋势图: 共 {{ summary.has_case_matches }} 条线索关联到历史案件
            </div>
            {% endif %}
        </div>

        <div class="section">
            <h2>⚠️ 异常线索明细</h2>
            {% if clues %}
            <table>
                <thead>
                    <tr>
                        <th>线索编号</th>
                        <th>类型</th>
                        <th>风险等级</th>
                        <th>报关单号</th>
                        <th>经营单位</th>
                        <th>收货人</th>
                        <th>HS编码</th>
                        <th>详情</th>
                    </tr>
                </thead>
                <tbody>
                    {% for clue in clues %}
                    <tr style="background: {{ clue.risk_level | risk_bg_color }};">
                        <td style="font-family: monospace; font-size: 12px;">{{ clue.clue_no }}</td>
                        <td><span class="type-tag">{{ clue.type_name }}</span></td>
                        <td>
                            {% if clue.risk_level == '高风险' %}
                            <span class="risk-badge high">高风险</span>
                            {% elif clue.risk_level == '中风险' %}
                            <span class="risk-badge medium">中风险</span>
                            {% else %}
                            <span class="risk-badge low">低风险</span>
                            {% endif %}
                        </td>
                        <td style="font-family: monospace;">{{ clue.declaration_no or '-' }}</td>
                        <td>{{ clue.company or '-' }}</td>
                        <td>{{ clue.consignee or '-' }}</td>
                        <td style="font-family: monospace;">{{ clue.hs_code or '-' }}</td>
                        <td>
                            {% if clue.detection_type == 'lowprice' %}
                            偏离 <strong>{{ clue.deviation_percent | format_percent }}</strong><br>
                            <small>均价: {{ clue.industry_avg_price | format_number }} | 申报: {{ clue.declared_price | format_number }}</small>
                            {% elif clue.detection_type == 'split' %}
                            <strong>{{ clue.shipment_count }}</strong> 票 / 总值 {{ clue.total_value | format_number }}<br>
                            <small>窗口: {{ clue.window_start | format_date }} ~ {{ clue.window_end | format_date }}</small>
                            {% elif clue.detection_type == 'fake' %}
                            关键词: {{ clue.expected_keywords }}<br>
                            <small>品名: {{ clue.actual_description }}</small>
                            {% elif clue.detection_type == 'abnormal' %}
                            新通道: <strong>{{ clue.route }}</strong><br>
                            <small>历史: {{ clue.historical_routes }}</small>
                            {% endif %}

                            {% if clue.similarity_score %}
                            <div class="case-match">
                                <strong>🔗 案例关联</strong> ({{ (clue.similarity_score * 100) | round(1) }}%)
                                案件编号: {{ clue.matched_cases }}
                            </div>
                            {% endif %}
                        </td>
                    </tr>
                    {% endfor %}
                </tbody>
            </table>
            {% else %}
            <div class="empty-state">
                ✅ 未检测到异常线索
            </div>
            {% endif %}
        </div>

        <div class="section">
            <h2>🗄️ 数据库统计</h2>
            <table>
                <thead>
                    <tr>
                        <th>数据表</th>
                        <th>记录数</th>
                        <th>说明</th>
                    </tr>
                </thead>
                <tbody>
                    <tr><td>报关单数据</td><td style="font-weight: 600;">{{ db_stats.declarations | format_number }}</td><td>已入库的进出口报关单</td></tr>
                    <tr><td>风险布控指令</td><td style="font-weight: 600;">{{ db_stats.risk_controls | format_number }}</td><td>海关风险布控指令</td></tr>
                    <tr><td>口岸查验反馈</td><td style="font-weight: 600;">{{ db_stats.inspections | format_number }}</td><td>现场查验结果反馈</td></tr>
                    <tr><td>历史案件库</td><td style="font-weight: 600;">{{ db_stats.cases | format_number }}</td><td>已结案走私案件</td></tr>
                    <tr><td>风险线索</td><td style="font-weight: 600;">{{ db_stats.clues | format_number }}</td><td>系统检测异常线索</td></tr>
                </tbody>
            </table>
            {% if db_stats.date_range %}
            <p style="margin-top: 12px; color: #6b7280; font-size: 13px;">
                📅 数据时间范围: {{ db_stats.date_range[0] | format_date }} 至 {{ db_stats.date_range[1] | format_date }}
            </p>
            {% endif %}
        </div>

        <div style="text-align: center; color: #9ca3af; font-size: 12px; margin-top: 20px; padding: 20px;">
            本报告由海关缉私情报分析系统 (CRISK) 自动生成 | 机密文件，请注意保管
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
